message: If you use udlex, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "udlex: fast dictionary lemmatization"
abstract: >-
  A dictionary lemmatizer with a Rust core and Python, C and Go interfaces,
  with dictionaries for 224 languages built from Universal Dependencies 2.19
  and open dictionaries.
